</tr>
<tr>
<td>Starwheel</td>
<td>Yes, pocket holds each container</td>
<td>Round containers</td>
<td>Starwheel and guide swap</td>
<td>Starwheel and guide set per size</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Speed-differential belt</td>
<td>No, friction only</td>
<td>Any shape</td>
<td>Recipe</td>
<td>Number of belt zones and drives</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Flight (lug) conveyor</td>
<td>Yes, flight pushes each product</td>
<td>Any shape</td>
<td>Recipe, plus flight change for some sizes</td>
